nonical URL matches the sourceRef URL, and offsets 705-797 slice retainedText exactly to the quoted extract. The retained context attributes the formal descriptions to Bill Evans' liner-note discussion, and the extract specifically states that \"Blue in Green\" has a ten-measure cycle after a short four-measure introduction."},{"claimId":"031-miles-davis-kind-of-blue-2148074c:1:4:fact-1","decisionId":"031-miles-davis-kind-of-blue-2148074c:1:4:fact-1","decision":"supported","artifactIds":["31b23551038bfd342a26624838407ad105125f22a69f7f8338f4f39d85a79cbb"],"sourceUrls":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kind_of_Blue"],"rationale":"The referenced artifact exists, its canonical URL matches the sourceRef URL, and offsets 804-855 slice retainedText exactly to the quoted extract. The retained context attributes the track-form descriptions to Bill Evans' liner-note discussion, and the extract specifically describes \"All Blues\" as a twelve-bar blues form in 6/8 time."},{"claimId":"031-miles-davis-kind-of-blue-2148074c:1:5:fact-1","decisionId":"031-miles-davis-kind-of-blue-2148074c:1:5:fact-1","decision":"supported","artifactIds":["31b23551038bfd342a26624838407ad105125f22a69f7f8338f4f39d85a79cbb"],"sourceUrls":["https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Kind_of_Blue"],"rationale":"The referenced artifact exists, its canonical URL matches the sourceRef URL, and offsets 856-989 slice retainedText exactly to the quoted extract. The retained context attributes the modal descriptions to Bill Evans' liner-note discussion, and the extract specifically states that \"Flamenco Sketches\" uses five scales played until the soloist completes the series."}]}